Z||000000||turbo86se||06-03-2000||05:13 PM||||<BR>This weekend's LPGA golf tournament is being held here in Murrells Inlet at the Wachesaw East golf course. The course is only 5 minutes from my house, and I get to play there all the time! I love networking  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>If you get a chance, check it out, it's on ESPN today and tomorrow, maybe you'll see me there tomorrow, standing by the 17th green. To me that is the most difficult hole on the course. Long par 5, dog-leg left, elevated green surrounded by a creek. Best I've ever done on 17 is bogey. <BR>Check it out, it's where I call home!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
